<title>USA: American National Bancorp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>American National Bancorp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			    981			673</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $N/A		     $N/A</p>
<p> Net			  1,100		    1,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
